  "description": "High-performance, deterministic coherent-noise generation for voxel and terrain workloads. Perlin, OpenSimplex2, Value and Cellular noise in 2D and 3D, with fractal (fBm/ridged/ping-pong) layering, domain warping, and a composition graph for building complex overlapping noise. Single-point sampling plus bulk grid/volume fills that are bit-identical across scalar, SIMD and parallel backends.",
